# Agent worktrees. Without this, `git add -A` in the main checkout stages the
# worktree directories as gitlinks (mode 160000).
.claude/worktrees/
.todo-worktrees/

# Review-loop artifacts that are REGENERATED every iteration. The harness
# (.loop/*.py), the roster, the triage ledger and the 70 recorded reviews are
# the evidence worth keeping; the packets, the plan and the rendered diagram
# are derived output, several hundred KB apiece, and would be stale in the
# repo the moment the next iteration runs.
.loop/arch.png
.loop/packet*.md
.loop/PLAN.md
